  <compounddef id="group__Debug" kind="group">
    <compoundname>Debug</compoundname>
    <title>wolfSSL Error Handling and Reporting</title>
      <sectiondef kind="func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__Debug_1ga192a2501d23697c2b56ce26b1af0eb2c" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>int</type>
        <definition>int wolfSSL_Debugging_ON</definition>
        <argsstring>(void)</argsstring>
        <name>wolfSSL_Debugging_ON</name>
        <param>
          <type>void</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>ビルド時にロギングが有効になっている場合、この関数は実行時にロギングをオンにします。ビルド時にログ記録を有効にするには<ndash/>enable-debugまたはdebug_wolfsslを定義します。 </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>If logging has been enabled at build time this function turns on logging at runtime. To enable logging at build time use <ndash/>enable-debug or define DEBUG_WOLFSSL.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>0 成功すると。 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>NOT_COMPILED_IN このビルドに対してロギングが有効になっていない場合は返されるエラーです。 <emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">wolfSSL_Debugging_ON();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1gafa8dab742182b891d80300fb195399ce" kindref="member">wolfSSL_Debugging_OFF</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Logging_1ga48df7024025bb41d2cb614aa56d1c472" kindref="member">wolfSSL_SetLoggingCb</ref></para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>0 upon success. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>NOT_COMPILED_IN is the error that will be returned if logging isn’t enabled for this build.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>none</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>No parameters.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">wolfSSL_Debugging_ON();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1gafa8dab742182b891d80300fb195399ce" kindref="member">wolfSSL_Debugging_OFF</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Logging_1ga48df7024025bb41d2cb614aa56d1c472" kindref="member">wolfSSL_SetLoggingCb</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
