      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__Debug_1ga189182293f00f0fc2fac37d8be4582d4" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>char *</type>
        <definition>char * wolfSSL_ERR_error_string</definition>
        <argsstring>(unsigned long, char *)</argsstring>
        <name>wolfSSL_ERR_error_string</name>
        <param>
          <type>unsigned long</type>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>char *</type>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>この関数は、wolfssl_get_error（）によって返されたエラーコードをより人間が読めるエラー文字列に変換します。errnumberは、wolfssl_get_error（）によって返され、データはエラー文字列が配置されるストレージバッファです。MAX_ERROR_SZで定義されているように、データの最大長はデフォルトで80文字です。これはwolfssl / wolfcrypt / error.hです。 </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function converts an error code returned by <ref refid="group__Debug_1gaafd5671d443fa684913ba5955a4eb591" kindref="member">wolfSSL_get_error()</ref> into a more human-readable error string. errNumber is the error code returned by <ref refid="group__Debug_1gaafd5671d443fa684913ba5955a4eb591" kindref="member">wolfSSL_get_error()</ref> and data is the storage buffer which the error string will be placed in. The maximum length of data is 80 characters by default, as defined by MAX_ERROR_SZ is wolfssl/wolfcrypt/error.h.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>success 正常に完了すると、この関数はデータに返されるのと同じ文字列を返します。 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>failure 失敗すると、この関数は適切な障害理由、MSGを持つ文字列を返します。 </para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>errNumber</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>wolfssl_get_error（）によって返されたエラーコード。 <emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>err<sp/>=<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">WOLFSSL*<sp/>ssl;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">char<sp/>buffer[80];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">err<sp/>=<sp/>wolfSSL_get_error(ssl,<sp/>0);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">wolfSSL_ERR_error_string(err,<sp/>buffer);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">printf(“err<sp/>=<sp/>%d,<sp/>%s\n”,<sp/>err,<sp/>buffer);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1gaafd5671d443fa684913ba5955a4eb591" kindref="member">wolfSSL_get_error</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1ga508a388e80c30a9925b47fb6077f5bf3" kindref="member">wolfSSL_ERR_error_string_n</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1ga3f82460752b93314b1ad70acc623135c" kindref="member">wolfSSL_ERR_print_errors_fp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1ga688146c77e8d4b693d81c4a1f295b126" kindref="member">wolfSSL_load_error_strings</ref></para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>success On successful completion, this function returns the same string as is returned in data. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>failure Upon failure, this function returns a string with the appropriate failure reason, msg.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>errNumber</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>error code returned by <ref refid="group__Debug_1gaafd5671d443fa684913ba5955a4eb591" kindref="member">wolfSSL_get_error()</ref>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>data</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>output buffer containing human-readable error string matching errNumber.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<emphasis>Example</emphasis> <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">int<sp/>err<sp/>=<sp/>0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">WOLFSSL*<sp/>ssl;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">char<sp/>buffer[80];</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">err<sp/>=<sp/>wolfSSL_get_error(ssl,<sp/>0);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">wolfSSL_ERR_error_string(err,<sp/>buffer);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">printf(“err<sp/>=<sp/>%d,<sp/>%s\n”,<sp/>err,<sp/>buffer);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1gaafd5671d443fa684913ba5955a4eb591" kindref="member">wolfSSL_get_error</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1ga508a388e80c30a9925b47fb6077f5bf3" kindref="member">wolfSSL_ERR_error_string_n</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1ga3f82460752b93314b1ad70acc623135c" kindref="member">wolfSSL_ERR_print_errors_fp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__Debug_1ga688146c77e8d4b693d81c4a1f295b126" kindref="member">wolfSSL_load_error_strings</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
        <location file="dox_comments/header_files/ja/ssl.h" line="2286" column="6" declfile="dox_comments/header_files/ja/ssl.h" declline="2286" declcolumn="6"/>
